.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/*
**/*.iml
**/GIT_IGNORE**
**/.terraform/*
**/__pycache__/*
**/.tool-versions
**/.sisyphus/**

# Claude Code — ignore ephemeral/sensitive, track config.
# settings.json is deliberately NOT tracked: it's per-machine (model, plugins,
# hooks) and Claude Code auto-writes to it (plugin installs), so tracking it
# means constant dirty noise + machines clobbering each other.
.claude/**
!.claude/statusline.sh
!.claude/track-mcp-usage.sh
!.claude/RTK.md
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/mcp-servers.json
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

**/.claude/settings.local.json
